ords": ["VR", "RoomEscape", "horror", "Decryption"], "long_description": " In December 24, Dana\u2019s child was getting cold in his arms as the chimes of midnight struck. After his parents died, his wife died in childbirth, the young businessman lost his last relative. The Christmas came to town, except the cold foreign-style house.\n   Shortly afterwards, Rumor has it that the young businessman was mad. He always holds the picture of his family and talk to the people around him with a creepy smile that he was play hide-and-seek with his child. People all ridiculed him, so he just leaves lonely. Gradually, people don\u2019t see him anymore, he and his house was forgotten in this wasteland.", "short_description": "\"MIST \" is a first-person perspective of the chamber to escape decryption game. Players are in an abandoned foreign house where it has cold floors, decrepit furniture and swaying lights. This environment make players to continuously discover new clues , after players solve the puzzles and walk out every room, they could escape from the house successfully at last."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://www.mq11034182.icoc.me/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://www.mq11034182.icoc.me/", "publisher_name": "\u718a\u5fd7\u52c7", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "http://www.mq11034182.icoc.me/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": null, "genres": ["EXPLORATION", "HORROR", "PUZZLE", "SIMULATION", "STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["TOUCHPAD"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "627993741638688"}}]}, 